     sum_n e^{-2aE_n} -- a sum over the WHOLE spectrum, i.e. an extensive quantity
     that changes smoothly with every E_n.  A change of the gap alone moves it by
     the amount of the level itself (e^{-2a*1} = 0.275601 at a=1),
     indistinguishable from a change of any other level: no threshold, no direction.

