==============================================================================
SUMMARY (candidate 2 / Choi rank)
==============================================================================
 - Choi rank of the canonical map (conjugation by T) is 1 identically (W1): a class
   constant, same on the free massless field -- zero discriminating power.
 - the Choi operator of Ad(V) is a RANK-ONE projector: spectrum {||V||_F^2,0,...,0}
   => there is no second eigenvalue, so no coordinate in which a gap could appear.
 - rank > 1 needs a non-unitary ingredient whose strength lam is a modelling choice,
   and the rank is then a STEP function of lam (W2) -- an integer with no threshold value.
 - the only surviving real scalar is ||e^{-aH}||_F^2 = Z(2a), extensive & UV-dominated,
   smooth through the gap closure (W3,W4) -- the corpus's dead thermodynamic reading.
 - verdict:  D16 (integer/rigid invariant vs real infimum) with D10 + D15 + D2 as
   companions.  NO non-circular Choi-rank-type criterion can be constructed.
